"value":"Yes, enhancement in the revised submission"},{"id":248925293,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_ctu","indicator_name":"Provided additional Information for clarity, transparency, and understanding","value":"No previous submission available"},{"id":248925488,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_ctu","indicator_name":"Provided additional Information for clarity, transparency, and understanding","value":"No revision compared with previous version"},{"id":248925663,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_ctu","indicator_name":"Provided additional Information for clarity, transparency, and understanding","value":"Yes, enhancement in the revised submission"},{"id":248925859,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"The Republic of Colombia commits to reduce its greenhouse gas emissions by 20% with respect to the projected Business-as-Usual Scenario (BAU) by 2030.\u003cbr /\u003e\"Subject to the provision of international support, Colombia could increase its ambition from 20% reduction with respect to BAU to 30% with respect to BAU by 2030.\"\u003cbr /\u003eThe INDC also includes a section on adaptation."},{"id":248926051,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"The Republic of Colombia commits to reduce its greenhouse gas emissions by 20% with respect to the projected Business-as-Usual Scenario (BAU) by 2030.\u003cbr /\u003e\"Subject to the provision of international support, Colombia could increase its ambition from 20% reduction with respect to BAU to 30% with respect to BAU by 2030.\"\u003cbr /\u003eThe INDC also includes a section on adaptation."},{"id":248926226,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"\u003cp\u003ePlease note that the NDC was submitted only in Spanish. WRI did its best to translate the NDC language. If any errors are identified, please contact us at \u003ca href=\"mailto:ClimateWatch@WRI.org\"\u003eClimateWatch@WRI.org\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\"Colombia commits to maximum of 169.44 MtCO2e in 2030 (equivalent to 51% reduction compared to BAU) and reduce black carbon emissions by 40% compared to 2014 in 2030.\"\u003cbr\u003eThe revised first NDC also includes a section on adaptation."},{"id":248926512,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"Please note that the NDC was submitted only in Spanish. WRI did its best to translate the NDC language. If any errors are identified, please contact us at ClimateWatch@WRI.org.\u003cbr\u003e\"In 2035, Colombia will emit a maximum of between 155 and 161 MtCO2eq.\""},{"id":248926587,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"mitigation_contribution_type","indicator_name":"Mitigation contribution type","value":"GHG target"},{"id":248926782,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"mitigation_contribution_type","indicator_name":"Mitigation contribution type","value":"GHG target"},{"id":248926957,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"mitigation_contribution_type","indicator_name":"Mitigation contribution type","value":"GHG target"},{"id":248927243,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"mitigation_contribution_type","indicator_name":"Mitigation contribution type","value":"GHG target"},{"id":248927313,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target","indicator_name":"GHG target","value":"20% (unconditional) to 30% (conditional) reduction in GHG emissions by 2030 compared to the BAU scenario"},{"id":248927473,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target","indicator_name":"GHG target","value":"20% (unconditional) to 30% (conditional) reduction in GHG emissions by 2030 compared to the BAU scenario"},{"id":248927638,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target","indicator_name":"GHG target","value":"Maximum of 169.44 MtCO2e in 2030 (equivalent to 51% reduction compared to BAU)\u003cbr\u003eReduce black carbon emissions by 40% compared to 2014 in 2030."},{"id":248927924,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target","indicator_name":"GHG target","value":"Colombia commits to emitting no more than 155-161 MtCO2e in 2035."},{"id":248927996,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Mitigation, Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target, Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target_type","indicator_name":"GHG target type","value":"Baseline scenario target"},{"id":248928186,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Mitigation, Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target, Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target_type","indicator_name":"GHG target type","value":"Baseline scenario target"},{"id":248928360,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Mitigation, Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target, Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target_type","indicator_name":"GHG target type","value":"Fixed level target"},{"id":248928646,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Mitigation, Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target, Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target_type","indicator_name":"GHG target type","value":"Fixed level target"},{"id":248928881,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"non_ghg_target","indicator_name":"Non-GHG target","value":"No top-line non-GHG target.\u003cbr\u003eSee Annex A4 and Annex M1 for more detailed information on sectoral targets."},{"id":248929052,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"time_target_year","indicator_name":"Target year (mitigation)","value":"\u003cp\u003e2030\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"Based on the outcome of the climate negotiations in Paris in the COP 21, Colombia will consider communicating an indicative target for 2025, consistent with its 2030 target.\"\u003c/p\u003e"},{"id":248929247,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"time_target_year","indicator_name":"Target year (mitigation)","value":"\u003cp\u003e2030\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"Based on the outcome of the climate negotiations in Paris in the COP 21, Colombia will consider communicating an indicative target for 2025, consistent with its 2030 target.\"\u003c/p\u003e"},{"id":248929420,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"time_target_year","indicator_name":"Target year (mitigation)","value":"2030"},{"id":248929706,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"time_target_year","indicator_name":"Target year (mitigation)","value":"2035"},{"id":248930036,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"timeframe","indicator_name":"Timeframe for implementation","value":"Not Specified"},{"id":248930214,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"COL","country":"Colombia","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"s